      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "thresholds": {"min_abs_daily_paper_ic": 0.007, "min_abs_daily_paper_icir": 0.084},
    "regime_notes": "Positive full-history 5d/10d/20d IC. 2024+ 10d IC 0.029938 and ICIR 0.092806; 2026+ weakened to IC 0.011382 and ICIR 0.035332; 2027+ IC 0.021951 and ICIR 0.072423; 2028 YTD is strong but short (IC 0.188062, ICIR 0.693865, 108 dates). Interpret the small 15-asset cross-section conservatively.",
